WEBVTT

00:24.770 --> 00:25.810
<b>[grunts]</b>

00:26.810 --> 00:27.650
<b>[gasps]</b>

00:29.980 --> 00:32.900
<b>[grunting]</b>

00:34.740 --> 00:36.740
<b>[panting]</b>

00:43.620 --> 00:44.830
<b>[grunts]</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:46.580
<b>[panting]</b>

00:50.670 --> 00:52.210
<b>[coughing]</b>

01:13.150 --> 01:15.070
<b>["Black Gold" by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

01:15.150 --> 01:18.620
<b>♪ Brought in a world ♪</b>

01:19.280 --> 01:24.790
<b>♪ World so brand new
Endless possibilities ♪</b>

01:26.080 --> 01:29.960
<b>♪ A whole new identity ♪</b>

01:30.460 --> 01:32.710
<b>♪ Can't you see? ♪</b>

01:33.460 --> 01:37.300
<b>♪ Black gold of the sun ♪</b>

01:37.380 --> 01:40.050
<b>♪ Open up your eyes ♪</b>

01:40.140 --> 01:42.720
<b>♪ Open up your heart ♪</b>

01:42.810 --> 01:45.640
<b>♪ And feel the sunshine ♪</b>

01:45.730 --> 01:48.060
<b>♪ Black diamond ♪</b>

01:48.560 --> 01:51.230
<b>♪ I just want to be ♪</b>

01:51.310 --> 01:53.980
<b>♪ Where I'm supposed to be ♪</b>

01:55.030 --> 01:57.650
<b>♪ And that's right here with you ♪</b>

02:09.540 --> 02:14.250
<b>♪ Don't mistake my kindness for weakness ♪</b>

02:14.340 --> 02:17.010
<b>♪ 'Cause I'm strong, you see ♪</b>

02:17.090 --> 02:20.050
<b>♪ Stronger than you'll ever be ♪</b>

02:22.010 --> 02:24.430
<b>♪ Loyal to me ♪</b>

02:24.510 --> 02:27.350
<b>♪ Someone to call my friend ♪</b>

02:27.430 --> 02:30.270
<b>♪ Whenever you need me ♪</b>

02:30.350 --> 02:33.110
<b>♪ I'll be right here ♪</b>

02:33.190 --> 02:35.480
<b>♪ Love and loyalty ♪</b>

02:35.980 --> 02:38.570
<b>♪ Trust and honesty ♪</b>

02:39.700 --> 02:42.200
<b>♪ I'll never let go ♪</b>

02:56.130 --> 02:59.300
<b>[Nobunaga] Power armor mechs
were the Mongols' advantage.</b>

02:59.380 --> 03:01.890
<b>It's how they conquered
the Japanese settlements</b>

03:01.970 --> 03:03.470
<b>of Tsushima and Iki Islands.</b>

03:03.550 --> 03:05.180
<b>After we defeated them,</b>

03:05.680 --> 03:10.100
<b>we took this technological advancement
for ourselves to strengthen our borders.</b>

03:10.190 --> 03:13.940
<b>-[deep, rhythmic drumbeats]
-The ancestors say knowledge is power.</b>

03:14.020 --> 03:15.900
<b>I respectfully disagree.</b>

03:15.980 --> 03:17.860
<b>Power is power.</b>

03:19.110 --> 03:20.320
<b>[grunting]</b>

03:20.400 --> 03:24.160
<b>[Nobunaga] A simple concept
my son cannot seem to grasp.</b>

03:25.030 --> 03:30.210
<b>Nobukatsu's defeat to Hattori Hanzo
will be told for generations to come.</b>

03:30.290 --> 03:32.460
<b>A mark my legacy cannot afford.</b>

03:32.540 --> 03:34.540
<b>[panting]</b>

03:42.180 --> 03:43.720
<b>[both grunting]</b>

03:51.100 --> 03:53.060
<b>[slow applause]</b>

04:02.030 --> 04:04.950
<b>[man] My lord,
what brings you to the training grounds?</b>

04:05.030 --> 04:07.620
<b>[Nobunaga] Our upcoming
parley with the Iga general.</b>

04:07.700 --> 04:10.120
<b>Yasuke and Natsumaru will accompany you.</b>

04:11.410 --> 04:14.330
<b>If I may, that would be a mistake.</b>

04:14.920 --> 04:17.840
<b>I fear the rest of society
will not accept the… [hesitates]</b>

04:17.920 --> 04:20.090
<b>…liberties you've taken with our culture.</b>

04:20.170 --> 04:24.430
<b>Yasuke has proven to have
a fine military mind in his own right.</b>

04:24.510 --> 04:27.180
<b>As good as you, perhaps even better.</b>

04:27.800 --> 04:31.600
<b>How can we ever progress
when our instinct is to recede?</b>

04:31.680 --> 04:36.230
<b>I want the Iga Clan to see a glimpse
of how bright our country's future can be.</b>

04:36.310 --> 04:37.230
<b>[Mitsuhide scoffs]</b>

04:37.310 --> 04:40.530
<b>My lord, if you continue
to add these outsiders to our ranks,</b>

04:40.610 --> 04:42.860
<b>your enemies will neither fear
nor respect us.</b>

04:42.940 --> 04:45.240
<b>Yasuke is not one of us.</b>

04:45.320 --> 04:47.620
<b>Our people will not accept him.</b>

04:47.700 --> 04:52.910
<b>I will soon represent the people,
and I will usher them into a new world.</b>

04:54.460 --> 04:55.620
<b>[scoffs]</b>

05:05.680 --> 05:07.430
<b>He really does not like me.</b>

05:07.970 --> 05:09.680
<b>Give Mitsuhide time.</b>

05:09.760 --> 05:13.100
<b>Nobunaga puts faith in you
he does not show in others.</b>

05:13.180 --> 05:15.100
<b>That can rub some the wrong way.</b>

05:15.180 --> 05:17.400
<b>[chuckles] And how does it rub you?</b>

05:17.480 --> 05:22.650
<b>Nobunaga believes in the Onna Bugeisha.
So, you and I are alike.</b>

05:23.190 --> 05:24.030
<b>Huh.</b>

05:26.070 --> 05:27.490
<b>It's nothing.</b>

05:28.070 --> 05:30.410
<b>The seal from my family crest,</b>

05:30.490 --> 05:33.540
<b>given to me by my mother
and her mother before her.</b>

05:33.620 --> 05:34.910
<b>It's honorable.</b>

05:35.000 --> 05:38.210
<b>The past informs our future.
It shows who we are.</b>

05:41.000 --> 05:43.420
<b>[birds squawking]</b>

05:51.260 --> 05:53.680
<b>Did you find the child?</b>

05:53.770 --> 05:56.680
<b>We did. The woman who took her--</b>

05:56.770 --> 05:57.770
<b>[old man] Ichika.</b>

05:58.560 --> 05:59.690
<b>What of her?</b>

05:59.770 --> 06:02.360
<b>More trouble than expected.</b>

06:02.440 --> 06:04.900
<b>A boatsman who fought like a warrior.</b>

06:04.980 --> 06:07.150
<b>-A warrior?
-[thrusters whooshing]</b>

06:07.240 --> 06:08.820
<b>-[robot] And…
-[loud thud]</b>

06:08.910 --> 06:10.160
<b>…he is Black.</b>

06:10.240 --> 06:12.620
<b>Hm. Is he from the Benin Kingdom like you?</b>

06:12.700 --> 06:13.530
<b>Shut up.</b>

06:13.620 --> 06:15.580
<b>And he took down the four of you?</b>

06:16.080 --> 06:19.040
<b>Perhaps I should have bought
his services instead.</b>

06:19.120 --> 06:21.960
<b>You didn't say the girl was powered.</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:23.880
<b>That will cost extra.</b>

06:23.960 --> 06:25.170
<b>[old man] Of course.</b>

06:25.250 --> 06:29.630
<b>He will provide
all that is required and earned.</b>

06:30.840 --> 06:32.050
<b>[robot] Who is "he"?</b>

06:32.140 --> 06:34.180
<b>The god he prays to.</b>

06:40.190 --> 06:41.650
<b>[breathing shakily]</b>

06:41.730 --> 06:43.690
<b>I told you everything, promise!</b>

06:43.770 --> 06:45.690
<b>I don't know anything.</b>

06:45.780 --> 06:48.190
<b>Shh. Sh, sh, sh, sh.</b>

06:48.280 --> 06:50.860
<b>It's okay, my child.</b>

06:50.950 --> 06:53.200
<b>You have nothing more to fear from me.</b>

06:53.280 --> 06:56.080
<b>But who is the Black boatsman?</b>

06:56.580 --> 06:59.710
<b>He stands in the way of your salvation.</b>

07:00.500 --> 07:02.630
<b>[shakily] He-- He fishes by the river.</b>

07:02.710 --> 07:05.380
<b>Sometimes he drinks
at the bar by the village.</b>

07:05.880 --> 07:09.220
<b>[whimpering] He's a quiet man.
I swear that's all I know.</b>

07:09.800 --> 07:12.390
<b>What is his name?</b>

07:12.890 --> 07:15.300
<b>[shakily] He-- He has no name.</b>

07:15.810 --> 07:19.560
<b>[priest] Some say you can see better
when you are stressed.</b>

07:20.060 --> 07:23.100
<b>That you can see his almighty presence.</b>

07:23.190 --> 07:24.940
<b>Can you see it?</b>

07:25.440 --> 07:27.320
<b>[man groaning]</b>

07:27.400 --> 07:28.480
<b>-[crunching]
-[grunts]</b>

07:32.700 --> 07:34.370
<b>That's it.</b>

07:36.580 --> 07:38.200
<b>Now you can see.</b>

07:39.580 --> 07:43.370
<b>Why don't we just kill the girl?
It would make things a lot easier.</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:48.000
<b>No, the girl is key to controlling
Europe and the Catholic Church.</b>

07:48.590 --> 07:51.630
<b>We are close to achieving real power.</b>

07:57.350 --> 07:58.180
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

08:02.600 --> 08:03.440
<b>[sighs]</b>

08:09.030 --> 08:10.900
<b>[groans softly]</b>

08:19.290 --> 08:21.160
<b>[panting]</b>

08:21.250 --> 08:23.460
<b>What happened? Where's my mother?</b>

08:26.790 --> 08:29.420
<b>[gentle electronic music plays]</b>

08:32.550 --> 08:33.970
<b>[Saki] Yassan.</b>

08:34.050 --> 08:36.340
<b>Why won't you tell me where my mother is?</b>

08:37.760 --> 08:39.850
<b>I do not know where your mother is.</b>

08:39.930 --> 08:42.180
<b>I lost her
during the fray with those people.</b>

08:42.680 --> 08:45.270
<b>Do you remember
what happened after they attacked us?</b>

08:45.350 --> 08:47.440
<b>There was a light. You remember it?</b>

08:47.940 --> 08:49.150
<b>No.</b>

08:50.070 --> 08:54.610
<b>I just remember feeling helpless
and wanting the fighting to stop.</b>

08:54.700 --> 08:56.160
<b>[Yasuke sighs]</b>

08:57.110 --> 08:59.830
<b>Did your mother
ever tell you where you came from?</b>

08:59.910 --> 09:00.740
<b>[Saki] Why?</b>

09:03.080 --> 09:05.410
<b>The past, it informs our future.</b>

09:06.710 --> 09:09.380
<b>-[crickets chirping]
-[owl hooting]</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:29.270
<b>The full might of Lord Oda Nobunaga's
forces can gather at a moment's notice,</b>

09:29.360 --> 09:31.270
<b>ready to descend upon your people.</b>

09:31.860 --> 09:37.280
<b>But my lord sends his seven samurai
instead, as a sign of respect.</b>

09:37.360 --> 09:39.700
<b>Surrender your two castles now,</b>

09:39.780 --> 09:42.910
<b>and perhaps my lord
will show mercy upon your people.</b>

09:48.040 --> 09:50.670
<b>[Iga general] I only see five samurai.</b>

09:50.750 --> 09:51.670
<b>[grunts]</b>

09:51.750 --> 09:55.460
<b>[Iga general] The way of the samurai
is the purest form of Japanese culture.</b>

09:55.550 --> 09:59.760
<b>Oda Nobunaga insults our culture
when he allows a woman and a slave</b>

09:59.840 --> 10:03.060
<b>to bear the titles
reserved for Japanese men.</b>

10:03.140 --> 10:05.680
<b>He doesn't deserve to bear the title.</b>

10:05.770 --> 10:09.440
<b>Send over your Black samurai,
and I will show you.</b>

10:10.730 --> 10:11.770
<b>Wait here.</b>

10:11.860 --> 10:13.820
<b>The Black samurai you shall have.</b>

10:17.240 --> 10:19.530
<b>[Natsumaru] What happened?
Did they surrender?</b>

10:20.030 --> 10:22.530
<b>-They did not.
-[Natsumaru] What did they say?</b>

10:23.030 --> 10:25.290
<b>They wish to settle this the old way.</b>

10:26.080 --> 10:27.660
<b>You against him.</b>

10:27.750 --> 10:29.250
<b>And you agreed to this?</b>

10:29.330 --> 10:32.290
<b>Nobunaga does not respect the old ways.</b>

10:32.380 --> 10:33.670
<b>These people do.</b>

10:33.750 --> 10:36.710
<b>They will not surrender
to people like you or him.</b>

10:36.800 --> 10:40.470
<b>To most, you will always be a servant,</b>

10:40.550 --> 10:42.680
<b>no matter what armor you wear.</b>

10:51.400 --> 10:52.610
<b>[horse nickers]</b>

11:02.620 --> 11:04.120
<b>[horse neighs]</b>

11:04.200 --> 11:06.240
<b>Lay down your weapons.</b>

11:06.330 --> 11:08.540
<b>Lord Nobunaga accepts your surrender.</b>

11:09.250 --> 11:11.170
<b>Your lives will be spared.</b>

11:11.250 --> 11:12.880
<b>On this, you have my word.</b>

11:12.960 --> 11:15.500
<b>[Iga general]
This slave speaks for Nobunaga?</b>

11:15.590 --> 11:19.050
<b>This unification
will not be welcomed by the Iga Clan.</b>

11:19.130 --> 11:22.430
<b>I will send him back
to Nobunaga with a severed head.</b>

11:22.510 --> 11:26.760
<b>Maybe then your drunken leader
will take our culture more seriously.</b>

12:04.300 --> 12:06.550
<b>[Iga general]
Nobunaga scoffs at tradition.</b>

12:06.640 --> 12:09.100
<b>He will not write his own history!</b>

12:09.180 --> 12:10.890
<b>[both grunting]</b>

12:18.860 --> 12:19.820
<b>[grunting]</b>

12:22.650 --> 12:25.490
<b>[Iga general straining, grunting]</b>

12:26.990 --> 12:28.280
<b>[resounding clang]</b>

12:28.370 --> 12:29.290
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:29.370 --> 12:31.410
<b>Kneel now, General.</b>

12:31.500 --> 12:35.540
<b>I do not wish to take your life.
There's no need for bloodshed.</b>

12:35.620 --> 12:36.790
<b>[doors opening]</b>

12:36.880 --> 12:39.800
<b>[doors creaking]</b>

12:39.880 --> 12:41.050
<b>[swords clattering]</b>

12:41.130 --> 12:44.050
<b>-[grunting softly]
-[rhythmic electronic music plays]</b>

12:44.130 --> 12:45.800
<b>[horse neighs]</b>

12:45.890 --> 12:48.550
<b>[Mitsuhide] There will be
no interference from you, woman.</b>

12:48.640 --> 12:51.180
<b>Let them finish the old way.</b>

12:51.270 --> 12:53.180
<b>-[music stops]
-[men breathing heavily]</b>

12:58.190 --> 13:00.570
<b>-[music resumes]
-[groaning]</b>

13:01.320 --> 13:02.490
<b>[men gasp]</b>

13:03.240 --> 13:04.070
<b>[grunting]</b>

13:05.280 --> 13:08.070
<b>[grunting]</b>

13:20.460 --> 13:22.670
<b>[gurgling, groaning]</b>

13:22.760 --> 13:25.130
<b>History will forget you!</b>

13:25.720 --> 13:27.130
<b>[general shouts]</b>

13:30.760 --> 13:31.680
<b>[thud]</b>

13:38.020 --> 13:38.900
<b>[thud]</b>

13:51.620 --> 13:52.700
<b>[metal clinking]</b>

14:02.210 --> 14:04.420
<b>There was no honor to be had here.</b>

14:04.510 --> 14:06.420
<b>Only pain and blood.</b>

14:07.010 --> 14:08.930
<b>[fire crackling]</b>

14:09.010 --> 14:11.010
<b>[crickets chirping]</b>

14:13.260 --> 14:15.270
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

14:20.980 --> 14:22.400
<b>[sniffing]</b>

14:23.520 --> 14:26.190
<b>This area is highly susceptible
to forest fires.</b>

14:26.280 --> 14:27.530
<b>[woman] Maybe it should burn.</b>

14:27.610 --> 14:29.530
<b>I'm going to get a crick in my neck</b>

14:29.610 --> 14:32.030
<b>if I have to look at you
up in a tree again.</b>

14:32.120 --> 14:34.290
<b>[woman] I like to see
things in all directions.</b>

14:34.870 --> 14:37.540
<b>One day, everything will burn.</b>

14:38.120 --> 14:40.080
<b>No place will be safe.</b>

14:40.170 --> 14:42.380
<b>[sniffs] The girl was here.</b>

14:42.460 --> 14:44.130
<b>Left not too long ago.</b>

14:45.840 --> 14:48.670
<b>There's something else. He was here.</b>

14:48.760 --> 14:50.300
<b>The boatsman.</b>

14:51.140 --> 14:53.050
<b>[music thuds ominously]</b>

14:57.140 --> 14:59.140
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

15:01.060 --> 15:02.690
<b>Why did you bring me back here?</b>

15:02.770 --> 15:06.440
<b>We need to get to the doctor.
He will know what to do.</b>

15:06.530 --> 15:08.490
<b>[Yasuke] Do you know who the doctor is?</b>

15:09.030 --> 15:09.900
<b>No.</b>

15:09.990 --> 15:12.070
<b>[Yasuke] Do you know where the doctor is?</b>

15:12.620 --> 15:13.450
<b>No.</b>

15:13.530 --> 15:15.580
<b>[Yasuke]
Your mother is the only one who knows</b>

15:15.660 --> 15:17.200
<b>who this doctor is and where to go.</b>

15:18.040 --> 15:19.000
<b>And she's gone.</b>

15:19.540 --> 15:22.500
<b>So, we go find her
so she can lead us to the doctor.</b>

15:22.580 --> 15:24.750
<b>You gave your word, Yassan.</b>

15:25.840 --> 15:28.670
<b>[Yasuke] Your mother did not survive
the encounter on the river.</b>

15:28.760 --> 15:30.300
<b>-[gasps]
-[Yasuke] I'm sorry.</b>

15:33.430 --> 15:34.850
<b>[crying]</b>

15:38.680 --> 15:40.850
<b>[panting]</b>

15:44.440 --> 15:45.730
<b>No! [cries]</b>

15:45.810 --> 15:47.480
<b>[sobbing]</b>

16:07.670 --> 16:08.840
<b>[man chuckling]</b>

16:08.920 --> 16:10.010
<b>[overlapping chatter]</b>

16:10.090 --> 16:11.130
<b>[man] Cheers.</b>

16:14.590 --> 16:15.760
<b>No pun intended.</b>

16:21.890 --> 16:23.270
<b>[Natsumaru] Smile.</b>

16:23.850 --> 16:26.230
<b>You're the man who slayed an Iga general.</b>

16:26.310 --> 16:30.320
<b>Nobunaga celebrates your victory
while you sit here in your sorrow.</b>

16:30.860 --> 16:31.860
<b>Why?</b>

16:31.940 --> 16:33.200
<b>[Yasuke groans softly]</b>

16:33.280 --> 16:36.530
<b>Death is a part of conflict.
It doesn't mean I have to enjoy it.</b>

16:37.280 --> 16:42.290
<b>Why are you here with me in this sorrow
instead of out enjoying the festivities?</b>

16:42.370 --> 16:47.170
<b>Celebrations are a part of victory.
No one said I had to enjoy them.</b>

16:50.250 --> 16:54.220
<b>Do you believe
in Nobunaga's quest to unify Japan?</b>

16:54.930 --> 16:58.680
<b>[Yasuke] Yes. I believe there are those
who wish to be left alone,</b>

16:58.760 --> 17:01.640
<b>but a united country
is a country free of war.</b>

17:01.720 --> 17:03.680
<b>[Natsumaru] Unity is not freedom.</b>

17:03.770 --> 17:06.230
<b>Culture has us trade
one ruler for another.</b>

17:06.310 --> 17:10.020
<b>All we really have
in this world is our individual loyalties.</b>

17:10.110 --> 17:12.530
<b>That is the way of the samurai.</b>

17:13.110 --> 17:15.400
<b>And our actions
against the Iga Clan allowed</b>

17:15.490 --> 17:18.660
<b>for the slaughter
of innocent women and children.</b>

17:20.990 --> 17:24.660
<b>[scoffs] A complete victory
for a noble lord.</b>

17:26.620 --> 17:28.670
<b>[gong clangs]</b>

17:44.020 --> 17:47.350
<b>[Nobunaga]
We are in reach of the very objective</b>

17:47.440 --> 17:50.770
<b>we set out to accomplish
all those years ago.</b>

17:50.860 --> 17:56.200
<b>My only wish is that they join us
as we write our own history.</b>

17:56.280 --> 17:59.410
<b>A better Japan. A greater Japan.</b>

17:59.490 --> 18:02.830
<b>United together,
stronger than ever before.</b>

18:02.910 --> 18:07.210
<b>Free to do whatever you want,
with whomever you want.</b>

18:07.790 --> 18:09.210
<b>[groans softly]</b>

18:09.290 --> 18:10.830
<b>[Nobunaga] Yasuke!</b>

18:10.920 --> 18:12.090
<b>Come, my son.</b>

18:12.170 --> 18:13.840
<b>-[grunts]
-[gasps]</b>

18:21.430 --> 18:22.510
<b>[suppressed grunting]</b>

18:29.190 --> 18:31.310
<b>I am proud of you.</b>

18:31.400 --> 18:33.860
<b>Let us celebrate
Yasuke's victory with a drink.</b>

18:34.530 --> 18:36.110
<b>To Yasuke.</b>

18:41.700 --> 18:44.370
<b>Ranmaru. Come.</b>

18:44.450 --> 18:46.370
<b>[liquid sloshing]</b>

18:52.380 --> 18:55.130
<b>[Mitsuhide] You are not one of us,
and yet he treats you as so.</b>

18:55.210 --> 18:57.460
<b>Even better than his own sons.</b>

18:58.090 --> 19:01.010
<b>Servants will always be servants.
That is our way.</b>

19:01.640 --> 19:02.890
<b>The old way.</b>

19:03.470 --> 19:06.680
<b>Perhaps the old way
should be left in the past.</b>

19:08.480 --> 19:10.690
<b>Perhaps I too belong in the past.</b>

19:11.350 --> 19:14.650
<b>Back when things
were straightforward and simple.</b>

19:19.280 --> 19:21.280
<b>[slurping]</b>

19:21.780 --> 19:23.070
<b>[sighs deeply]</b>

19:30.660 --> 19:32.580
<b>[man groans timidly]</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:38.210
<b>Well, there he is. As I live and breathe.</b>

19:38.710 --> 19:41.470
<b>The, uh, Black warrior.</b>

19:41.550 --> 19:43.550
<b>Fresh water, if you have it.</b>

19:47.390 --> 19:48.390
<b>Mm.</b>

19:51.190 --> 19:52.140
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:52.810 --> 19:54.480
<b>[muted, suspenseful music plays]</b>

19:56.060 --> 20:00.400
<b>Business brings me to Japan,
as I assume it did you.</b>

20:01.240 --> 20:03.450
<b>I am a servant of the church,</b>

20:03.530 --> 20:06.870
<b>sent here on a grave mission
to save the people.</b>

20:06.950 --> 20:12.250
<b>We have a prophecy
that a special child will one day come.</b>

20:12.750 --> 20:14.170
<b>And with my guidance,</b>

20:14.250 --> 20:18.590
<b>the child will help me bring
peace and order to my land.</b>

20:19.170 --> 20:24.510
<b>I have been here many years,
searching for this child.</b>

20:25.010 --> 20:26.220
<b>And guess what?</b>

20:28.310 --> 20:29.470
<b>I found her.</b>

20:29.970 --> 20:31.100
<b>But she was sick.</b>

20:31.600 --> 20:34.730
<b>She needed a woman to take care of her.</b>

20:35.480 --> 20:40.150
<b>But one day, that woman, whom I trusted,</b>

20:40.230 --> 20:43.990
<b>became a thief in the night
and stole the child from me.</b>

20:44.570 --> 20:48.740
<b>Now I've learned
you've come across that same woman.</b>

20:48.830 --> 20:53.410
<b>I don't know what she's told you,
but she cannot be trusted.</b>

20:53.910 --> 20:57.500
<b>Her lies and deceit
have brought me great pain.</b>

20:57.580 --> 21:00.840
<b>You can go home. I can go home.</b>

21:01.590 --> 21:03.840
<b>Just tell me where the child is.</b>

21:05.380 --> 21:06.220
<b>[sighs]</b>

21:06.720 --> 21:09.720
<b>A servant of the church
who wants to lead his people?</b>

21:09.810 --> 21:11.140
<b>[priest] Yes.</b>

21:11.220 --> 21:14.940
<b>Yet the idea of servanthood itself
is to submit and support.</b>

21:15.020 --> 21:18.060
<b>One must serve before he can lead.</b>

21:18.150 --> 21:20.650
<b>That is the natural progression of things.</b>

21:20.730 --> 21:24.740
<b>"Never lacking in zeal,
but keep your spiritual fervor,</b>

21:24.820 --> 21:25.990
<b>serving the Lord."</b>

21:26.700 --> 21:28.530
<b>Romans 12:11.</b>

21:28.620 --> 21:32.120
<b>I've learned over time,
servants will always be servants.</b>

21:32.910 --> 21:34.120
<b>That's the old way.</b>

21:35.040 --> 21:37.420
<b>Perhaps you'd be wise to learn the same.</b>

21:38.000 --> 21:39.500
<b>Where is the child?</b>

21:43.050 --> 21:45.010
<b>[laughing]</b>

21:45.720 --> 21:49.970
<b>-He will reveal all soon enough.
-[music intensifies ominously]</b>

21:52.310 --> 21:54.730
<b>-I need him alive.
-[robot grunting]</b>

21:55.640 --> 21:58.980
<b>Sorry, Boss.
I'm just having a little trouble.</b>

21:59.730 --> 22:00.860
<b>Hurry up.</b>

22:00.940 --> 22:03.610
<b>Before, no trouble.</b>

22:03.690 --> 22:06.860
<b>Now we want trouble, Chernyy.</b>

22:06.950 --> 22:10.320
<b>And payback for breaking my nose!</b>

22:11.330 --> 22:12.700
<b>[shouting]</b>

22:14.580 --> 22:16.500
<b>Boss wants him alive, right?</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:20.670
<b>[grunts, shouts]</b>

22:22.670 --> 22:23.500
<b>[grunts]</b>

22:23.590 --> 22:25.010
<b>[people murmuring]</b>

22:30.590 --> 22:31.760
<b>[growls]</b>

22:34.220 --> 22:35.390
<b>Initiating stun mode.</b>

22:35.470 --> 22:37.140
<b>[blaster whirring, fires]</b>

22:37.230 --> 22:39.140
<b>[explosion rumbling]</b>

22:46.360 --> 22:47.570
<b>[Yasuke grunting]</b>

22:50.320 --> 22:51.990
<b>-[growls]
-[grunts]</b>

22:54.910 --> 22:57.330
<b>[both grunting]</b>

23:05.460 --> 23:07.840
<b>-[woman chuckles]
-[crackling]</b>

23:07.920 --> 23:09.050
<b>[robot] Oh, no.</b>

23:10.130 --> 23:13.260
<b>-[whirring]
-[robot] Uh-oh.</b>

23:13.350 --> 23:14.850
<b>-[blaster fires]
-[crashing]</b>

23:15.680 --> 23:17.890
<b>[blaster firing]</b>

23:32.490 --> 23:34.910
<b>-[clanging]
-[powering down]</b>

23:41.000 --> 23:41.830
<b>Sorry.</b>

23:49.840 --> 23:50.840
<b>[grunts]</b>

23:56.560 --> 23:57.760
<b>[groans]</b>

23:59.770 --> 24:01.180
<b>[both grunting]</b>

24:02.980 --> 24:04.730
<b>[growling]</b>

24:07.480 --> 24:08.980
<b>-[roars]
-[grunts]</b>

24:11.070 --> 24:12.740
<b>[Yasuke shouting]</b>

24:16.950 --> 24:18.700
<b>[blaster whirring, fires]</b>

24:28.130 --> 24:29.380
<b>[grunts]</b>

24:30.260 --> 24:32.170
<b>[coughs, groaning]</b>

24:44.940 --> 24:46.610
<b>I like you, old man.</b>

24:54.030 --> 24:55.530
<b>[footsteps approaching]</b>

24:58.700 --> 25:02.080
<b>Salvation awaits.</b>

25:02.160 --> 25:03.120
<b>[crunch]</b>

25:04.870 --> 25:07.130
<b>["Between Memories"
by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

25:25.190 --> 25:26.770
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

25:26.850 --> 25:30.230
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

25:30.730 --> 25:32.860
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

25:32.940 --> 25:37.110
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

25:37.610 --> 25:40.830
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

25:41.410 --> 25:43.540
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

25:43.620 --> 25:48.040
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

25:48.540 --> 25:50.540
<b>[female vocalizing]</b>

25:53.590 --> 25:55.010
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

25:56.680 --> 25:59.180
<b>-[female vocalizing]
-♪ Come on ♪</b>

26:06.940 --> 26:08.810
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

26:08.900 --> 26:10.110
<b>♪ Come on ♪</b>

26:13.570 --> 26:15.570
<b>[girl laughing]</b>
